<title>RUSSIA: St Petersburg 728-day munis yield 20.29 pct.</title>
<headline>St Petersburg 728-day munis yield 20.29 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The annualised average yield on an issue of 728-day GGKO municipal bonds was 20.29 percent at an auction on Wednesday, general agent AVK said.</p>
<p>Full details of the auction follow:</p>
<p>    Series number			   SU36004GSPMO</p>
<p>    Volume				     80 bln rbls</p>
<p>    Denominations			   100,000 rbls</p>
<p>    Bids (nominal)			   80.88 bln rbls</p>
<p>    Sold					 42.98 bln rbls</p>
<p>    Proceeds				   30.60 bln rbls</p>
<p>    Average price			    71.19 pct</p>
<p>    Lowest accepted price		  71.00 pct</p>
<p>    Average yield			    20.29 pct</p>
<p>    Highest accepted yield		 20.48 pct</p>
<p>    Tenor					728 days</p>
<p>    Maturity date			    July 14, 1999</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
